WEBVTT

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.425
The river bent twice before it reached the old mill.

00:00:09.725 --> 00:00:16.300
Nobody in the village remembered who had built it, and the records that might have told them burned long ago.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.175
Each spring the water rose and covered the lower steps.

00:00:20.475 --> 00:00:27.200
Children dared each other to touch the rusted wheel, and their parents warned them, but the warnings never worked.
